Emulate the CDVD S-command registers (0x1F402016 SCOMMAND, 0x1F402017 SREADY/SDATAIN,
0x1F402018 SDATAOUT) on the MECHACON model, as PCSX2 CDVD.cpp does, so the original XCDVDMAN
send routine completes instead of polling absent registers. Add the boot front-panel and
drive-control S-commands (0x05, 0x08 clock, 0x14-0x16, 0x19, 0x1B, 0x1C, 0x24, 0x29, 0x31,
0x32); any other command fails naming its parameters.

